    title: "How to Build Local Citations Without Paying for Every Directory",
    metaTitle: "Build Local Citations Without Overpaying",
    excerpt: "A practical approach to building local citations that skips the paid directory spam and focuses on what actually influences rankings.",
    metaDescription: "Local citations still matter for contractor SEO, but paying for every directory listing isn't necessary. Here's a leaner, more effective approach.",
